    {
      "subId": "7419201",
      "subQuestName": "(test)常驻对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741920101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741920101": {
            "id": "741920101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "我看见：王座上的火焰已经熄灭，烧却的灰烬重新变成了树。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920102"
            ]
          },
          "741920102": {
            "id": "741920102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "花朵随着你的脚步绽放，你能给必然颓败的未来带来变化。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920103"
            ]
          },
          "741920103": {
            "id": "741920103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "夏诺蒂拉？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920104"
            ]
          },
          "741920104": {
            "id": "741920104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#咦，原来是{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}！你怎么会在这里？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920105"
            ]
          },
          "741920105": {
            "id": "741920105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "啊，对了！金色的蝴蝶已经回来了，要赶紧去看看才行！再见啦！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7419202",
      "subQuestName": "(test)常驻对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741920201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741920201": {
            "id": "741920201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "呜呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920202"
            ]
          },
          "741920202": {
            "id": "741920202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "夏诺蒂拉…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920203"
            ]
          },
          "741920203": {
            "id": "741920203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#咦？{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}…你是谁？我还以为，这里除了我谁也进不来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920204"
            ]
          },
          "741920204": {
            "id": "741920204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "你为什么知道我的名字？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920206",
              "741920208"
            ]
          },
          "741920206": {
            "id": "741920206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "骗人！你肯定也和那些怪物一样…"
          },
          "741920208": {
            "id": "741920208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "是喔…老是让她这么担心，我真是个坏孩子…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920209"
            ]
          },
          "741920209": {
            "id": "741920209",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#我是{NICKNAME}，你还记得吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920210"
            ]
          },
          "741920210": {
            "id": "741920210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，我想起来了…虽然是个一口能吞下世界的大怪兽，但是很善良。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7419203",
      "subQuestName": "(test)常驻对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741920301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741920301": {
            "id": "741920301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "既然记忆能被制作成书，那么反过来，书本中的内容，应该也能被直接写入记忆…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920302"
            ]
          },
          "741920302": {
            "id": "741920302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "夏诺蒂拉？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920303"
            ]
          },
          "741920303": {
            "id": "741920303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#啊，是奇奇怪怪的{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}。怎么了，找我有什么事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920304"
            ]
          },
          "741920304": {
            "id": "741920304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在说什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920305"
            ]
          },
          "741920305": {
            "id": "741920305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "嗯，不管怎么想，将「记忆」制作成书本都是相当不可思议的事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920306"
            ]
          },
          "741920306": {
            "id": "741920306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "制作这本书的人，一定将「记{RUBY#[D]妄想}忆」中的心情当作最为珍贵的事物，才能做出这样的书吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920307"
            ]
          },
          "741920307": {
            "id": "741920307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "不过这样子的书，确实很难懂…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920308"
            ]
          },
          "741920308": {
            "id": "741920308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "…而且，会对「读者」产生什么样的影响，也不知道。这可真是…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7419204",
      "subQuestName": "(test)常驻对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741920401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741920401": {
            "id": "741920401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920402"
            ]
          },
          "741920402": {
            "id": "741920402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "夏诺蒂拉？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920403"
            ]
          },
          "741920403": {
            "id": "741920403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "咦？你终于回来了！呜呜，我好担心，要是你一直回不来要怎么办…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920404"
            ]
          },
          "741920404": {
            "id": "741920404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "你进去以后，我一直在外面等，等了好久、好久。我去找别的美露莘帮忙，但大家都不知道怎么办…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920405"
            ]
          },
          "741920405": {
            "id": "741920405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（…看来我也在这里待得够久了。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920406"
            ]
          },
          "741920406": {
            "id": "741920406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我该走了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920407"
            ]
          },
          "741920407": {
            "id": "741920407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#咦？{NICKNAME}，你要去哪…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920408"
            ]
          },
          "741920408": {
            "id": "741920408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "别担心。我找到夏诺蒂拉就回来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920409"
            ]
          },
          "741920409": {
            "id": "741920409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "再稍微等我一下，好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920410"
            ]
          },
          "741920410": {
            "id": "741920410",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "虽然我知道，对你说这些也没用。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741920413"
            ]
          },
          "741920413": {
            "id": "741920413",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
